================================================================================================
WHICH DIFFERENCES ARE REAL
================================================================================================
  A gap smaller than the standard error OF THE DIFFERENCE is not a
  gap. |z| under 2 means the two cells cannot be told apart, and a
  reader who favours one over the other is acting on noise.

  comparison                             diff      se    |z|   verdict
  sent · 15m vs 30m                    +0.052   0.033    1.6   not separable
  sent · 30m vs 1h                     +0.018   0.043    0.4   not separable
  sent · 15m vs 1h                     +0.070   0.040    1.8   not separable
